event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":86,"item_id":"rs_0e1a2c81e7f74150016aca71917c408194b93c6030e0b4971f","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering testing and reusability**\n\nI’m thinking about whether I have enough time to test the new helper and decide if it’s acceptable to export it. Could I run standalone tests and maybe even copy the helper? It feels like testing in the same file could be useful, but I wonder if that's the best approach. Should I focus on reusing what I have, or is it better to start fresh? These are good questions to ponder!"}

